  "scope": {
    "scenario": "Retrospective operator-feed simulation: at each weekday forecast origin, the previous weekday's complete 18:00 net-flow panel is assumed available by 00:00 local time on the target date. All features use strictly earlier dates; no same-day pickups, dropoffs or weather.",
